                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Was actually looking for another place and ended up here after a bit of a trek up. Decided to just have lunch here. The tofu was crispy and the tea fried rice was delectable. Had the locally-grown tie guan yin tea as well. Very delicious meal with a good view. The hostess was very sweet and welcoming and even gave me complimentary chocolate fudge that she had made after my meal. Would definitely come back here.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
